[0,"o","\u001b[1;34m########################################################################################################################\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m    Exercise: Configure an Indirect Map\u001b[0m"]
[0.000031,"o","                                                                                 "]
[0.000109,"o","\u001b[1;34m        Requirements\u001b[0m                                                                                                    "]
[0.0001,"o","\u001b[1;34m          Hosts: servera (server), workstation (client)\u001b[0m                                                                 "]
[0.000064,"o","\u001b[1;34m          Prerequisite exercise: Configure a Direct Map\u001b[0m"]
[0.000051,"o","                                                                 "]
[0.000051,"o","\u001b[1;34m          Mount each subdirectory of a share on demand with one map entry\u001b[0m"]
[0.000053,"o","                                               "]
[0.000055,"o","\u001b[1;34m        Steps\u001b[0m"]
[0.000057,"o","                                                                                                           "]
[0.000049,"o","\u001b[1;34m          1. On servera, create /srv/regions with east and west subdirectories and export it\u001b[0m"]
[0.00005,"o","                            "]
[0.00006,"o","\u001b[1;34m          2. Reload the exports and verify with showmount --exports\u001b[0m"]
[0.00005,"o","                                                     "]
[0.000051,"o","\u001b[1;34m          3. On workstation, add a master map entry for /nfs/regions\u001b[0m"]
[0.000077,"o","                                                    "]
[0.000049,"o","\u001b[1;34m          4. Create the indirect map file with a wildcard entry\u001b[0m"]
[0.000051,"o","                                                         "]
[0.000052,"o","\u001b[1;34m          5. Restart the autofs service\u001b[0m"]
[0.000052,"o","                                                                                 "]
[0.000054,"o","\u001b[1;34m          6. Verify /nfs/regions is empty before accessing any subdirectory\u001b[0m"]
[0.00005,"o","                                             "]
[0.000048,"o","\u001b[1;34m          7. Access east and verify only it is mounted\u001b[0m"]
[0.000057,"o","                                                                  "]
[0.000052,"o","\u001b[1;34m          8. Access west and verify both are mounted\u001b[0m"]
[0.00005,"o","                                                                    "]
[0.000055,"o","\u001b[1;34m########################################################################################################################\u001b[0m"]
